      "text": "• Owner can allow auto-accept\n   within their own limits\n• Spot fake or abusive orders\n• Smarter search by meaning\n• Alerts (app / WhatsApp)\n• Payments (UPI / Razorpay)\n• Dashboards for cost and quality",
