      "text": "Rule: do not start Step 2 or later before Step 0 is done. If AI can change the database, today's loose rules become very risky.",
      "originalText": "Rule: do not start Step 2 or later before Step 0 is done. If AI can change the database, today's loose rules become very risky.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
